        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Modest Reed Style Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom decor for homes, right here is the U.S.A. They offer some of the most diverse and beautiful styles we carry.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nElegance from this simple design makes this Reed style appliance pull a very popular choice when dressing up freezers and refrigerators.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. Although this Appliance Pull is available in several lengths, we believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  First Impressions CFRBR Appliance Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: High Quality Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for appliance panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CFRBR-detail-picture.jpg?v=1718159559\" target=\"new\"><b>First Impressions CFRBR Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5  standard lengths.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBR-9: Total Length 9\" - Center to Center Mount - 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBR-12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount - 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBR-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBR-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 18\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBR-36: Total Length 36\" - Center to Center Mount - 30\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick  refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modest Reed Style Appliance Pull, FII-CFRBR",
                "description": "Modest Reed Style Refrigerator Door Pull from First Impressions. Elegance from the simple design make this Reed style appliance pull a very popular choice when dressing up freezers and refrigerators. Available in 9 different finish colors and 4 different lengths up to 24 inches.",
